{"id":72112,"date":"2026-10-31T21:47:34","date_gmt":"2026-10-31T21:47:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72112"},"modified":"2026-10-31T22:49:38","modified_gmt":"2026-10-31T21:49:38","slug":"cherry-winter-run-paul","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/cherry-winter-run-paul\/","title":{"rendered":"Cherry Winter Run 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Cherry Winter Run 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Cherry Winter Run 2026<\/strong> (2\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo do Paul) realiza-se no dia <strong>19 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), na vila do <strong>Paul<\/strong>, concelho da <strong>Covilh\u00e3<\/strong> e distrito de <strong>Castelo Branco<\/strong>. Com epicentro de partida e chegada no <strong>Complexo Desportivo da Raboleirada<\/strong> (Campo da Raboleirada), o evento acolhe em simult\u00e2neo o <strong>Campeonato Distrital de Estrada<\/strong> da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Castelo Branco, iniciando o programa competitivo \u00e0s <strong>15:00<\/strong> com os escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o e \u00e0s <strong>15:30<\/strong> para a prova rainha.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Situada no vale da <strong>Ribeira do Paul<\/strong>, na vertente sul da <strong>Serra da Estrela<\/strong>, a freguesia do Paul recebe os atletas num circuito de asfalto de 5 km. A prova principal de <strong>10 km<\/strong> (2 voltas de 5 km para Juniores, Seniores e Veteranos I, II e III) conta com 1 a 2 postos de abastecimento e cronometragem por chip no dorsal. O cartaz inclui ainda a corrida n\u00e3o competitiva <strong>Cherry 5K<\/strong> (1 volta de 5 km com subida ao p\u00f3dio e pr\u00e9mio de participa\u00e7\u00e3o para todos os finalistas), a <strong>Caminhada<\/strong> e as provas jovens: <strong>Cherry One Mile (1.600 m)<\/strong> para Infantis, Iniciados e Juvenis \u00e0s 15:00, <strong>Cherry Kids (300 m)<\/strong> para Benjamins A e B \u00e0s 15:20 e a <strong>Corrida da Pequenada \/ Cherry Babys (300 m)<\/strong> \u00e0s 15:21.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Paul Cultural Desportivo<\/strong> em colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com a <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal da Covilh\u00e3<\/strong> e a <strong>Junta de Freguesia do Paul<\/strong> (com suporte t\u00e9cnico da PTN \u2013 Eventos Desportivos e patroc\u00ednio principal do Cherry Sculpture Hotel), a prova assegura kit de atleta completo (t-shirt, saco, dorsal e medalha finisher), balne\u00e1rios para banhos junto \u00e0 meta e o tradicional refor\u00e7o alimentar de inverno com caldo verde, bifana e bebida \u00e0s 17:30. Descobre mais provas no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de 10 km<\/a> e calcula o teu ritmo na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">19 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Complexo Desportivo da Raboleirada (Paul),