gn-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Jovem (1.600 m)<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Cherry One Mile \u2014 Infantis, Iniciados e Juvenis (2009 a 2014)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 19 de Dezembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 15:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Escal\u00f5es Jovens:<\/strong> 5,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 13\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Cherry Kids \u2014 Benjamins A e B (2015 a 2018)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 19 de Dezembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 15:20<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Benjamins A e B:<\/strong> 2,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 13\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida da Pequenada \/ Cherry Babys (2019 a 2026)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 19 de Dezembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 15:21<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pequenada:<\/strong> 2,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 13\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Cherry Winter Run 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 2\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da Cherry Winter Run realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 19 de Dezembro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas no Complexo Desportivo da Raboleirada (Campo da Raboleirada), na freguesia do Paul, concelho da Covilh\u00e3 (distrito de Castelo Branco). O programa arranca \u00e0s 15:00 com a Cherry One Mile (1.600 m), seguindo-se as corridas jovens \u00e0s 15:20\/15:21 e a partida principal dos 10 km, Cherry 5K e Caminhada \u00e0s 15:30.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e prazos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Cherry Winter Run 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 13 de Dezembro de 2026 \u00e0s 23:59 com os seguintes valores: Corrida 10 km por 15,00 \u20ac (N\u00e3o Federados) ou 10,00 \u20ac (Atletas Federados); Corrida Cherry 5K por 15,00 \u20ac; Caminhada por 12,00 \u20ac; Corridas Jovens (Infantis, Iniciados e Juvenis - 1.600 m) por 5,00 \u20ac; e Benjamins A\/B e Corrida da Pequenada (300 m) por 2,00 \u20ac.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e at\u00e9 que horas funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona junto \u00e0 partida, no Complexo Desportivo da Raboleirada (Paul), a partir de sexta-feira, 18 de Dezembro de 2026, e no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova (19 de Dezembro) impreterivelmente at\u00e9 \u00e0s 14:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de atleta, banhos e refor\u00e7o alimentar?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es nos 10 km, Cherry 5K e escal\u00f5es de Infantis a Juvenis incluem t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, saco, dorsal com chip e medalha finisher (na Caminhada inclui t-shirt e saco; na Pequenada e Benjamins inclui dorsal e medalha finisher). Todos os inscritos t\u00eam direito a banhos nos balne\u00e1rios do Complexo Desportivo da Raboleirada e ao lanche conv\u00edvio final \u00e0s 17:30 com caldo verde, bifana e bebida.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza a prova e como funciona a classifica\u00e7\u00e3o por escal\u00f5es e equipas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Paul Cultural Desportivo, com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal da Covilh\u00e3, Junta de Freguesia do Paul e ajuizamento da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Castelo Branco. S\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos trof\u00e9us aos 3 primeiros classificados da geral e de cada escal\u00e3o (Benjamins A\/B, Infantis, Iniciados, Juvenis, Juniores, Seniores e Veteranos I, II e III), al\u00e9m de pr\u00e9mios coletivos mistos para as 3 melhores equipas de Benjamins, 3 melhores de Forma\u00e7\u00e3o e 5 melhores da Geral Absoluta.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Cherry Winter Run 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-19\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-19\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Complexo Desportivo da Raboleirada (Paul)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Covilh\u00e3\", \"addressRegion\": \"Castelo Branco\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A Cherry Winter Run 2026 realiza-se a 19 de dezembro no Paul, Covilh\u00e3. Corrida de 10 km, Cherry 5K, caminhada e provas jovens. Garante j\u00e1 o teu dorsal oficial!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-cherry-winter-run-paul.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Cherry Winter Run 10 km (Campeonato Distrital de Estrada)\", \"price\": \"15.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/waitastart.com\/evento\/2a-edicao-cherry-winter-run\/\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Cherry 5K (Corrida 5 km)\", \"price\": \"15.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/waitastart.com\/evento\/2a-edicao-cherry-winter-run\/\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada Cherry Winter Run\", \"price\": \"12.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/waitastart.